# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Binoculars are lightweight and portable.</b> Unless you have the luxury "
"to set up and operate an observatory from your deck, you are probably going "
"to travel to perform your viewings. Binoculars go with you much easier and "
"they are more lightweight to carry to the country and use while you are "
"there than a cumbersome telescope set up kit."
msgstr ""
"<b>Durbini su lagani i prenosni.</b> Osim ako nemate luksuz postaviti i "
"rukovati opservatoriju sa vaše terase, vjerovatno ćete putovati da izvodite "
"svoja posmatranja. Durbini idu sa vama mnogo lakše i lagži su za nošenje na "
"selo i korišćenje dok ste tamo od nezgrapnog teleskop kompleta."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Pick the brains of the experts</b>. If you are not already active in an "
"astronomy society or club, the sales people at the telescope store will be "
"able to guide you to the active societies in your area. Once you have "
"connections with people who have bought telescopes, you can get advice about"
" what works and what to avoid that is more valid than anything you will get "
"from a web article or a salesperson at Wal-Mart."
msgstr ""
"<b>Uzmi savjete stručnjaka</b>. Ako još niste aktivni u astronomskom društvu"
" ili klubu, prodajno osoblje u trgovini teleskopa moći će da vas usmjeri na "
"aktivna društva u vašem području. Jednom kada imate veze sa ljudima koji su "
"kupovali teleskope, možete dobiti savjete o tome što radi i što treba "
"izbjegavati što je valjaniji od bilo čega što ćete dobiti iz web članka ili "
"prodavca u Wal-Mart-u."

# model: code:addons/website_blog/static/src/tours/website_blog.js
#, []
msgid "<b>Publish your blog post</b> to make it visible to your visitors."
msgstr "6 postova"

# model: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_blog.opt_blog_post_comment
#, []
msgid "<b>Sign in</b>"
msgstr "7 postova"

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Try before you buy.</b> This is another advantage of going on some field "
"trips with the astronomy club. You can set aside some quality hours with "
"people who know telescopes and have their rigs set up to examine their "
"equipment, learn the key technical aspects, and try them out before you sink"
" money in your own set up."
msgstr ""
"<b>Probaj prije nego što kupiš.</b> Ovo je još jedna prednost odlaska na "
"neke terenske izlete sa astronomskim klubom. Možete izdvojiti neke "
"kvalitetne sate sa ljudima koji znaju teleskope i imaju svoju opremu "
"postavenu da ispitate njihovu opremu, naučite ključne tehničke aspekte, i "
"probate ih prije nego što uložite novac u svoju postavku."

# model: code:addons/website_blog/static/src/tours/website_blog.js
#, []
msgid ""
"<b>Write your story here.</b> Use the top toolbar to style your text: add an"
" image or table, set bold or italic, etc. Drag and drop building blocks for "
"more graphical blogs."
msgstr ""
"<b>Napišite svoju priču ovdje.</b> Koristite gornju alatnu traku za "
"stilizovanje teksta: dodajte sliku ili tabelu, postavite podebljano ili "
"iskošeno, itd. Povucite i ispustite građevinske blokove za grafičkije "
"blogove."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_1
#, []
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Apart from the native population, the local wildlife "
"is also a major crowd puller.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Osim domaćeg stanovništva, lokalna divljina je takođe "
"glavna atrakcija.</em>"

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, []
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">It is critically important that you get just the right"
" telescope.</em>"
msgstr "<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Kritički je važno da dobijete pravi teleskop.</em>"

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
#, []
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">That “Wow” moment is what astrology is all about.</em>"
msgstr "<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Taj \"Vau\" momenat je ono što je astrologija.</em>"

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_3
#, []
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">The more reviews you read, the more you notice how "
"they tend to cluster at the extremes of opinion.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Što više recenzija čitate, više primjećujete kako se "
"grupišu na ekstremima mišljenja.</em>"

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_5
#, []
msgid "<em class=\"h4 my-0\">There is something timeless about the cosmos.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<b>To je to, vaš blog post je objavljen!</b> Otkrijte više funkcionalnosti "
"kroz <i>Customize</i> meni."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
#, []
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Your study of the moon, like anything else, can go "
"from the simple to the very complex.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Vaša studija mjeseca, kao i svega ostalog, može ići od"
" jednostavnog do vrlo složenog.</em>"

