# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
#, []
msgid ""
"Becoming part of the society of devoted amateur astronomers will give you "
"access to these organized efforts to reach new levels in our ability to "
"study the Earth’s moon. And it will give you peers and friends who share "
"your passion for astronomy and who can share their experience and areas of "
"expertise as you seek to find where you might look next in the huge night "
"sky, at the moon and beyond it in your quest for knowledge about the "
"seemingly endless universe above us."
msgstr ""
"Postajanje dioem društva posvećenih astronoma amatera daće vam pristup ovim "
"organiziranim naporima da dosegnete nove nivoe u našoj sposobnosti "
"proučavanja Zemljinog mjeseca. I daće vam kolege i prijatelje koji dijele "
"vašu strast za astronomiju i koji mogu podijeliti svoje iskustvo i oblasti "
"stručnosti dok pokušavate da nađete gdje možda sljedeće da gledate u ogromno"
" noćno nebo, na mjesec i iza njega u vašoj potrazi za znanjem o naizgled "
