# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
#, []
msgid ""
"For many of us who are city dwellers, we don’t really notice that sky up "
"there on a routine basis. The lights of the city do a good job of disguising"
" the amazing display that is above all of our heads all of the time."
msgstr ""
"Mnogi od nas koji smo gradski stanovnici stvarno ne primjećujemo to nebo "
"gore na rutinskoj osnovi. Gradska svjetla dobro maskiraju nevjerovatan "
"prikaz koji je iznad svih naših glava cijelo vrijeme."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
#, []
msgid ""
"For many of us, our very first experience of learning about the celestial "
"bodies begins when we saw our first full moon in the sky. It is truly a "
"magnificent view even to the naked eye."
msgstr ""
"Za mnoge od nas, naše prvo iskustvo učenja o nebeskim tijelima počinje kada "
"smo vidjeli svoj prvi pun mjesec na nebu. To je zaista veličanstven pogled "
"čak i golim okom."

