#, []
msgid "In"
msgstr "Evo ideja iza Odoo komunikacijskih alata:"

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, []
msgid ""
"In many ways, it is a big step from someone who is just fooling around with "
"astronomy to a serious student of the science. But you and I both know that "
"there is still another big step after buying a telescope before you really "
"know how to use it."
msgstr ""
"Na mnogo načina, to je veliki korak od nekoga ko se samo igra astronomijom "
"do ozbiljnog studenta nauke. Ali vi i ja oboje znamo da postoji još jedan "
"veliki korak nakon kupovine teleskopa prije nego što stvarno znate kako ga "
"koristiti."

