# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_5
#, []
msgid ""
"It is great fun to start learning the constellations, how to navigate the "
"night sky and find the planets and the famous stars. There are web sites and"
" books galore to guide you."
msgstr ""
"Velika je zabava početi učiti sazviježđa, kako se kretati noćnim nebom i "
"pronaći planete i poznate zvijezde. Postoje brojne web stranice i knjige "
"koje će vas voditi."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_3
#, []
msgid ""
"It is important to choose a hotel that makes you feel comfortable – "
"contemporary or traditional furnishings, local decor or international, "
"formal or relaxed. The ideal hotel directory should let you know of the "
"options available."
msgstr ""
"Važno je odabrati hotel u kojem se osjećate ugodno – savremen ili "
"tradicionalan namještaj, lokalna ili međunarodna dekoracija, formalna ili "
"opuštena. Idealan hotelski imenik treba da vam pruži informacije o dostupnim"
" opcijama."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
#, []
msgid ""
"It is safe to say that at some point on our lives, each and every one of us "
"has that moment when we are suddenly stunned when we come face to face with "
"the enormity of the universe that we see in the night sky."
msgstr ""
"Sa sigurnošću se može reći da u nekom trenutku našeg života, svako od nas "
"ima taj trenutak kada smo iznenada zapanjeni kada se suočimo s ogromnošću "
"univerzuma koji vidimo na noćnom nebu."

# model:
# model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_blog.s_dynamic_snippet_blog_posts_list_preview_data
#, []
msgid ""
"It is safe to say that at some point on our lives, each and every one of us "
"has that moment when we are suddenly stunned when we come face to face with "
"the enormity of the universe that we..."
msgstr ""
"Sa sigurnošću se može reći da u nekom trenutku našeg života, svako od nas "
"ima taj trenutak kada smo iznenada zapanjeni kada se suočimo s ogromnošću "
"univerzuma koji..."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_5
#, []
msgid ""
"It really is amazing when you think about it that just by looking up on any "
"given night, you could see virtually hundreds of thousands of stars, star "
"systems, planets, moons, asteroids, comets and maybe a even an occasional "
"space shuttle might wander by. It is even more breathtaking when you realize"
" that the sky you are looking up at is for all intents and purposes the "
"exact same sky that our ancestors hundreds and thousands of years ago "
"enjoyed when they just looked up."
msgstr ""
"Zaista je zapanjujuće kad razmislite o tome da samo gledajući gore u bilo "
"kojoj noći, možete vidjeti praktično stotine hiljada zvijezda, zvjezdanih "
"sistema, planeta, mjeseca, asteroida, kometa i možda čak i povremeni "
"svemirski šatl koji prolazi. Još je veličanstvenije kada shvatite da je nebo"
" u koje gledate u suštini potpuno isto nebo u kojem su naši preci stotinama "
"i hiljadama godina ranije uživali kada bi samo pogledali gore."

