# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_3
#, []
msgid ""
"Ten years ago, you’d have probably visited your local travel agent and "
"trusted the face-to-face advice you were given by the so called ‘experts’. "
"The 21st Century way to select and book your hotel is of course on the "
"Internet, by using travel websites."
msgstr ""
"Prije deset godina, vjerovatno biste posjetili svog lokalnog turističkog "
"agenta i vjerovali savjetu licem u lice koji su vam dali takozvani "
"„stručnjaci“. Način 21. vijeka za odabir i rezervaciju hotela je naravno "
"preko interneta, koristeći turističke web stranice."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
#, []
msgid ""
"That “Wow” moment is what astrology is all about. For some, that wow moment "
"becomes a passion that leads to a career studying the stars. For a lucky "
"few, that wow moment because an all consuming obsession that leads to them "
"traveling to the stars in the space shuttle or on one of our early space "
"missions. But for most of us astrology may become a pastime or a regular "
"hobby. But we carry that wow moment with us for the rest of our lives and "
"begin looking for ways to look deeper and learn more about the spectacular "
"universe we see in the millions of stars above us each night."
msgstr ""
"Taj „Wow“ trenutak je suština astrologije. Za neke, taj wow trenutak postaje"
" strast koja vodi u karijeru proučavanja zvijezda. Za nekoliko sretnika, taj"
" wow trenutak postaje sveobuhvatna opsesija koja ih vodi do putovanja "
"zvijezdama u svemirskom šatlu ili na jednoj od ranih svemirskih misija. Ali "
"za većinu nas astrologija može postati razonoda ili redovan hobi. Ali mi "
"nosimo taj wow trenutak sa sobom do kraja života i počinjemo tražiti načine "
"da gledamo dublje i naučimo više o spektakularnom univerzumu koji vidimo u "
"milionima zvijezda iznad nas svake noći."

# model: model:blog.post,subtitle:website_blog.blog_post_5
#, []
msgid "The beauty of astronomy is that anybody can do it."
msgstr "Ljepota astronomije je što je svatko može raditi."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
#, []
msgid ""
"The best time to view the moon, obviously, is at night when there are few "
"clouds and the weather is accommodating for a long and lasting study. The "
"first quarter yields the greatest detail of study. And don’t be fooled but "
"the blotting out of part of the moon when it is not in full moon stage. The "
"phenomenon known as “earthshine” gives you the ability to see the darkened "
"part of the moon with some detail as well, even if the moon is only at "
"quarter or half display."
msgstr ""
"Najbolje vrijeme za posmatranje Mjeseca je naravno noću kada je malo oblaka "
"i vrijeme pogoduje dugom i dugotrajnom proučavanju. Prva četvrt daje najveći"
" detalj proučavanja. I nemojte se zavarati skrivanjem dijela Mjeseca kada "
"nije u fazi punog Mjeseca. Fenomen poznat kao „zemljin sjaj“ daje vam "
"mogućnost da vidite zatamljeni dio Mjeseca sa nekim detaljima, čak i kada je"
" Mjesec samo u četvrtini ili polovini."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
#, []
msgid "The best time to view the moon."
msgstr "Najbolje vrijeme za posmatranje Mjeseca."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_2
#, []
msgid ""
"The cliffs in this region are among the highest in the world and to see "
"water cascading from the high peaks is simply breathtaking. The short jaunt "
"from Maui with Maui helicopter tours is well worth seeing the beauty of this"
" natural environment."
msgstr ""
"Litice u ovoj regiji su među najvišima u svijetu i vidjeti vodu kako se "
"kaskadno spušta sa visokih vrhova je jednostavno zadivljujuće. Kratak izlet "
"sa Mauija sa helikopter turama vrijedi vidjeti ljepotu ovog prirodnog "
"okruženja."

# model:
# model:ir.model.fields,help:website_blog.field_blog_blog__website_absolute_url
#, []
msgid "The full absolute URL to access the document through the website."
msgstr "Puni apsolutni URL za pristup dokumentu putem web stranice."

# model: model:ir.model.fields,help:website_blog.field_blog_blog__website_url
#, []
msgid "The full relative URL to access the document through the website."
msgstr "Potpuni relativni URL za pristup dokumentu putem web stranice."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
#, []
msgid ""
"The next thing we naturally want to get is a good telescope. You may have "
"seen a hobbyist who is well along in their study setting up those really "
"cool looking telescopes on a hill somewhere. That excites the amateur "
"astronomer in you because that must be the logical next step in the growth "
"of your hobby. But how to buy a good telescope can be downright confusing "
"and intimidating."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća stvar koju prirodno želimo nabaviti je dobar teleskop. Možda ste "
"vidjeli hobistu koji je daleko u svom proučavanju kako postavlja te zaista "
"cool teleskope negdje na brdu. To uzbuđuje amaterskog astronoma u vama jer "
"to mora biti logičan sljedeći korak u rastu vašeg hobija. Ali kako kupiti "
"dobar teleskop može biti vrlo zbunjujuće i zastrašujuće."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_3
#, []
msgid ""
"The site should offer a detailed analysis of leisure services within the "
"hotel – spa, pool, gym, sauna – as well as details of any other facilities "
"nearby such as golf courses. 7. Special Needs: the hotel directory site "
"should advise the visitor of each hotel’s special needs services and "
"accessibility policy. Whilst again this does not apply to every visitor, it "
"is absolutely vital to some."
msgstr ""
"Stranica bi trebala ponuditi detaljnu analizu usluga za odmor u hotelu – "
"spa, bazen, teretana, sauna – kao i detalje o drugim sadržajima u blizini "
"poput golf terena. 7. Posebne potrebe: hotelski direktorij trebao bi "
"posjetitelja obavijestiti o uslugama za posebne potrebe svakog hotela i "
"politici pristupačnosti. Iako se ovo ne odnosi na svakog posjetitelja, za "
"neke je apsolutno vitalno."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, []
msgid ""
"The tripod or other accessory decisions will change significantly with a "
"telescope that will live on your deck versus one that you plan to take to "
"many remote locations."
msgstr ""
"Odluke o stativu ili drugim dodacima značajno će se razlikovati za teleskop "
"koji će živjeti na vašoj terasi naspram onog koji planirate odnijeti na "
"mnoge udaljene lokacije."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_2
#, []
msgid ""
"The view of this is truly breathtaking and is a sight not to be missed. It "
"is also highly educational with a chance to see a dormant volcano up close, "
"something that can not be seen every day. On the northern and southern sides"
" of the volcano, you will see an incredible different view however. These "
"sides are lush and green and you will be able to see some beautiful "
"waterfalls and gorgeous brush. Tropical rainforests abound on this side of "
"the island and it is something that is not easily accessible by any other "
"means than by air."
msgstr ""
"Pogled na ovo je zaista zadivljujuć i prizor koji se ne smije propustiti. "
"Također je vrlo edukativan sa prilikom vidjeti uspavani vulkan izbliza, što "
"se ne može vidjeti svaki dan. Na sjevernoj i južnoj strani vulkana, vidjet "
"ćete međutim neverovatno drugačiji pogled. Ove strane su bujne i zelene i "
"moći ćete vidjeti prelijepe vodopade i prekrasno raslinje. Tropske kišne "
"šume obiluju na ovoj strani ostrva i to je nešto što nije lako dostupno "
"drugim sredstvima osim avionom."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_3
#, []
msgid ""
"Then there’s the problem of the reviewer’s motivation. The more reviews you "
"read, the more you notice how they tend to cluster at the extremes of "
"opinion. On one end, you have angry reviewers with axes to grind; at the "
"other, you have delighted guests who lavish praise beyond belief. You’ll not"
" be surprised to learn that hotels sometimes post their own glowing reviews,"
" or that competitor’s line up for the chance to lambaste the competition "
"with bad reviews. It makes sense to consider what is really important to you"
" when selecting a hotel. You should then choose an online hotel directory "
"that gives up-to-date, independent, impartial information that really "
"matters."
msgstr ""
"Tu je i problem motivacije recenzenta. Što više recenzija pročitate, više "
"primjećujete kako se grupišu na ekstremima mišljenja. Na jednom kraju imate "
"ljutite recenzente sa starim računima; na drugom imate oduševljene goste "
"koji obasipaju pohvalama preko vjerovanja. Neće vas iznenaditi saznanje da "
"hoteli ponekad objavljuju vlastite sjajne recenzije, ili da se konkurenti "
"redaju za šansu da raznesu konkurenciju lošim recenzijama. Ima smisla "
"razmotriti šta vam je zaista važno prilikom odabira hotela. Trebali biste "
"tada odabrati online hotelski direktorij koji daje ažurne, nezavisne, "
"nepristrasne informacije koje zaista važe."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, []
msgid ""
"There are other considerations to factor into your final purchase decision."
msgstr ""
"Postoje i druga razmatranja koja treba uzeti u obzir prilikom konačne odluke"
" o kupovini."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_5
#, []
msgid ""
"There is something timeless about the cosmos. The fact that the planets and "
"the moon and the stars beyond them have been there for ages does something "
"to our sense of our place in the universe. In fact, many of the stars we "
"“see” with our naked eye are actually light that came from that star "
"hundreds of thousands of years ago. That light is just now reaching the "
"earth. So in a very real way, looking up is like time travel."
msgstr ""
"Postoji nešto bezvremeno u svemiru. Činjenica da su planete i Mjesec i "
"zvijezde iza njih tu vjekovima čini nešto našem osjećaju mjesta u svemiru. "
"Zapravo, mnoge zvijezde koje „vidimo“ golim okom su zapravo svjetlost koja "
"je došla sa te zvijezde stotinama hiljada godina ranije. Ta svjetlost tek "
"sada stiže do Zemlje. Dakle, na vrlo stvaran način, gledanje gore je poput "
"putovanja kroz vrijeme."

# model: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_3
#, []
msgid ""
"These things really do matter and any decent hotel directory should give you"
" this sort of advice on bedrooms – not just the number of rooms which is the"
" usual option!"
msgstr ""
"Ove stvari zaista važe i svaki pristojan hotelski direktorij trebao bi vam "
"dati ovakvu vrstu savjeta o spavaćim sobama – ne samo broj soba što je "
"uobičajena opcija!"

# model: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_blog.posts_loop
#, []
msgid "This box will not be visible to your visitors"
msgstr "Ovaj okvir neće biti vidljiv vašim posjetiteljima"

